WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.078
The key study varies the pseudo-norm exponent q.

00:00:03.158 --> 00:00:05.643
As q shrinks from one toward a quarter,

00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:10.249
the posterior median for a precision entry is
pulled less toward zero,

00:00:10.329 --> 00:00:12.617
reducing over-shrinkage as promised.

00:00:12.697 --> 00:00:19.459
At a lambda of zero point three the ninety-five
percent credible interval excludes zero for q below one,

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:25.051
while the Bayesian Lasso at q equals one still
includes zero and would drop the edge.

00:00:25.131 --> 00:00:27.090
A second knob, the temperature,

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.432
slides the model from the Bayesian regime to the
frequentist path.
